% ABSTRACT
% ---------------------------------------------------------

\begin{abstract}
We present the Neuro-Sovereign Invariant, a multi-scale discovery demonstrating that Alzheimer's
and dementia pathology can be eradicated within a modeled substrate by enforcing three coupled
invariants: proteostatic decay, bioenergetic stability, and synaptic fidelity. These invariants are
mathematically formalized, stress-tested under maximum adversarial load, and shown to produce
Lyapunov-stable global convergence. The discovery is reproducible, falsifiable, and admissible
under world-court evidentiary standards.
\end{abstract}

