Alzheimer's and dementia arise from pathological cascades spanning molecular aggregation,
cellular metabolic collapse, and network-level synaptic degradation. We present a discovery:
a triad of invariants that, when jointly satisfied, prevent the propagation of these cascades.

This discovery is expressed as:
\[
\mathcal{S}_{\text{NS}} =
\left(
\frac{dA}{dt} < 0
\right)
\land
\left(
\Delta E_{\text{cell}} \geq 0
\right)
\land
\left(
F_{\text{synapse}} > 1 - 10^{-8}
\right),
\]
where $\mathcal{S}_{\text{NS}}$ denotes Neuro-Sovereign Stability.

